&lt;h3&gt;Who we are:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gatik, the leader in autonomous middle-mile logistics, is revolutionizing the B2B supply chain with its autonomous transportation-as-a-service (ATaaS) solution and prioritizing safe, consistent deliveries while streamlining freight movement by reducing congestion. The company focuses on short-haul, B2B logistics for Fortune 500 retailers and in 2021 launched the world’s first fully driverless commercial transportation service with Walmart. Gatik&#39;s Class 3-7 autonomous trucks are commercially deployed across major markets, including Texas, Arkansas, and Ontario, Canada, driving innovation in freight transportation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The company&#39;s proprietary Level 4 autonomous technology, Gatik Carrier™, is custom-built to transport freight safely and efficiently between pick-up and drop-off locations on the middle mile. With robust capabilities in both highway and urban environments, Gatik Carrier™ serves as an all-encompassing solution that integrates advanced software and hardware powering the fleet, facilitating effortless integration into customers&#39; logistics operations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;20&quot; data-end=&quot;285&quot;&gt;Join&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Gatik&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;66&quot; data-end=&quot;81&quot;&gt;Rochester Hills, MI&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and help support the future of autonomous trucking. In this role, you will operate CDL or box trucks while working alongside advanced vehicle technology that powers Gatik’s middle-mile logistics network.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;287&quot; data-end=&quot;453&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;We’re looking for experienced,&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;safety-focused drivers&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;who are comfortable with new technology and excited to be part of the next generation of freight transportation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;css-1dhd1xm eu4oa1w0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;jd-appended-job-description&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;jd-section-employer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;jd-description-text&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Drive &amp;amp; Test:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Safely operate&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;26–30 ft box trucks&lt;/strong&gt;, monitor diagnostic screens, and execute test runs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Maintain Vehicle Standards:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Proactively manage vehicle upkeep, coordinate vendor repairs, and ensure no truck returns to service with unresolved defects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Rigorous DVIRs:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Complete accurate pre- and post-trip Driver Vehicle Inspection Reports (DVIRs) to catch and document issues before hit the road.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Engineering Feedback:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Record software and hardware behavior clearly to help refine autonomous technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Proactive Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Escalate risks early, follow through on maintenance requests, and take full responsibility for vehicle readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;3+ years&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;of professional driving experience, including&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;1+ year in 26–30 ft box trucks&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;(Required).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Licensing:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Valid CDL and clean Motor Vehicle Record (Required).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Safety &amp;amp; Ownership Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Commitment to prioritizing safety and fleet integrity over speed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Comfortable with Samsara ELD, timecard tools, Slack, email, and diagnostic apps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication&lt;/strong&gt;: Clear report writing, precise DVIR record-keeping, and strong vendor communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Physical Ability:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Excellent agility and reaction time to move quickly within confined cab seating without disturbing controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cab Access:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Ability to repeatedly mount and dismount 26–30 ft trucks using 3-point contact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Variable/rotating shift availability; must pass background check and drug screening; open to working through agency partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;More about Gatik&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot; data-qa=&quot;closing-description&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;css-1dhd1xm eu4oa1w0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;jd-appended-job-description&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;jd-section-job-work-location&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2017 by experts in autonomous vehicle technology, Gatik has rapidly expanded its presence to Santa Clara, Dallas-Fort Worth, Arkansas, and Toronto. As the &lt;em&gt;first and only&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;company to achieve fully driverless middle-mile commercial deliveries, Gatik holds a unique and defensible position in the AV industry, with a clear trajectory toward sustainable growth and profitability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have delivered complete, proprietary AV technology - an integration of software and hardware - to enable earlier successes for our clients in constrained Level 4 autonomy.&amp;nbsp; By choosing the middle mile – with defined point-to-point delivery, we have simplified some of the more complex AV challenges, enabling us to achieve full autonomy ahead of competitors. Given extensive knowledge of Gatik’s well-defined, fixed route ODDs and hybrid architecture, we are able to hyper-optimize our models with exponentially less data, establish gate-keeping mechanisms to maintain explainability, and ensure continued safety of the system for unmanned operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Visit us at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://gatik.ai/&quot;&gt;Gatik&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more company information and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://gatik.ai/careers/&quot;&gt;Careers at Gatik&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more open roles.&lt;/p&gt;
